                <mxCell id="p4_note" value="Why Cloud Tasks instead of inline?&#10;• Insulates the solyra React UI from minute-long agent runs&#10;• max-attempts=2 retries transient failures only&#10;• max-concurrent-dispatches=5 caps fan-out&#10;• Same Job binary runs scheduled batch — env vars switch the mode" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
